  <li><strong>Parent with school-hour gaps:</strong> house cleaning, errand running and bookkeeping can all happen between drop-off and pickup.</li>
  <li><strong>Oglethorpe or Georgia State student:</strong> tutoring, pet sitting and evening delivery work around a class schedule.</li>
